{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-hostile-species","chapterId":"handbook-monster-5012030","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-hostile-species-handbook-monster-5012030-handbook-monster-5012030-0","text":"常言道：「买书如山倒，读书如抽丝。」爱书之人总是不断购买新书，却鲜少翻开阅读。\n「未读如此之多」的罪恶感，和「我总有一天会去读」的自我欺骗，共同交织出了「攻击性阅读物」这一凶恶的幻造种。","speaker":""}]}
